// C-1 (credibility) — proof-links resolve to real, browsable files in the public
// clone-and-run image. Stage-1 (D1, 2026-06-19): repoint-to-public-image; every href
// returns 200 to an unauthenticated client (gate G6). Stage-2 (keystone, 2026-06-22):
// upgraded fixed → exemplary — the proofs now include Hearthstone's polished, published
// v8.0 base (the Home governance template + the exemplar Home bundle a fresh clone offers
// to bootstrap). Built from the single canonical REPO_HTTPS (SP-1; gate G5) so the
